top_reviews.content:
Halal!! Not sure what to make of this place; food was good; we had the Papadi chaat: not bad; the papas was a bit hard;  and there Saturday special: Chicken 65 Calupa: very tasty; the chalup is like a thick puri and the small mango cubes were a good touch

Atmosphere: very small tables and not enough for even 3 people; they also done do a good job of cleaning after someone leaves; it’s up to you to do it;
There is no service as you have to order on kiosk and menu is a bit confusing…
